  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon &#x2013; investment in sustainable mobility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF Start-up Loan Progoris BV will be able, together with the local subsidiary Wavebike SARL, to  expand the existing activities in the field of sustainable mobility. Progoris rents out electric bikes in Lebanon, B2C and B2B through a monthly subscription. This with the thought that bicycles are the ultimate means of transport for dense cities; fast and environmentally friendly. With this investment , they are expanding in Lebanon and emerging cities in the Region.In addition to local employment, the impact achieved with this funding also concerns a healthier urban living environment and climate change mitigation. The expected impact is local employment of approximately 51 FTE and knowledge exchange by training the staff.</narrative>
  </description>
